<title>ITALY: Italy's total reserves climb in September.</title>
<headline>Italy's total reserves climb in September.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's total reserves stood at 111.417 trillion lire at end-September, the Italian Exchange Office said in a statement.</p>
<p>The office gave the following data in trillions of lire:</p>
<p>				     Sept 96	Aug 96     Sept 95</p>
<p>    Total reserves	    111.417	109.686	92.302</p>
<p>    Total assets		113.165	111.438	94.311</p>
<p>     (of which in gold)	38.723	 39.479	41.524</p>
<p>    Liabilities		   1.748	  1.752	 2.009</p>
<p>    (of which short-term)	.204	   .202	  .304</p>
</text>
